## Support levels

<!-- if final -->
Myriarch is alpha software: interfaces and configuration may change between minor versions.

<!-- end final -->
| Area | Level | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Linux hosts (systemd) | beta | Installer and updater from the release files. |
| Container mode | beta | Enabled with `containerMode.enabled` of the collector chart ([container mode](https://github.com/{{REPOSITORY}}/blob/{{TAG}}/docs/design/container-mode.md)). |
| Windows hosts | experimental | |
| Helm chart | experimental | Installed from the tag, or from v0.2.0 on as a signed OCI chart. The collector chart `oci://ghcr.io/myriarch/charts/myriarch-collector` (version `{{VERSION}}`) runs the unchanged upstream OpAMP Supervisor and collector images; both charts are signed and attested by `release.yml` at `{{TAG}}`, verify them as in [verify releases](https://github.com/{{REPOSITORY}}/blob/{{TAG}}/docs/security/verify-releases.md#verify-the-helm-chart). |

## Known limitations

- PostgreSQL is required: release builds have no embedded database ([development guide](https://github.com/{{REPOSITORY}}/blob/{{TAG}}/docs/development.md#release-builds-omit-devpg)).
- Rate limits and sign-in backoff are kept per replica ([security model](https://github.com/{{REPOSITORY}}/blob/{{TAG}}/docs/security/model.md#known-limitations)).
- Under App Control script enforcement the unsigned Windows installer runs in Constrained Language Mode and fails: allow it by hash ([security model](https://github.com/{{REPOSITORY}}/blob/{{TAG}}/docs/security/model.md#known-limitations)).
- macOS binaries are not signed or notarized: download them with curl, or remove the quarantine attribute with `xattr -d com.apple.quarantine <file>` ([verify releases](https://github.com/{{REPOSITORY}}/blob/{{TAG}}/docs/security/verify-releases.md)).
- The images have no `latest` tag during v0.x. ghcr.io lists tags named `sha256-<hex>` that hold the signatures and attestations: do not delete them.

